# Gives week 2's book, nothing else (staff: a lost copy, execute as NAME run function ...).
give @s minecraft:written_book[minecraft:written_book_content={title:"The First Loosening",author:"Mira Salt-Hand",pages:["A rope that never moves is a noose. Ruk knew it. When his people grew loud and strong, he climbed out to the edge at dusk and let out an arm's length of rope.","The Hollow drew back, and new land rolled in to fill the gap: hills nobody had walked, rivers with no names. Ruk named none of them. 'Let them argue about it,' he said.","That is why your border breaks. Not a storm, not a curse. A monkey letting out rope, because you got too big for the old circle."]},minecraft:lore=[{text:"Page 2 of 11, the Knotkeeper's chronicle",color:"gray",italic:0b}]]
